  <string name="link_unreachable">the laptop did not take the connection. Check that Edgepad is running on it and that its Bluetooth, or its Wi-Fi and USB connections, are on. If a Bluetooth laptop still fails, remove the pairing on both this phone and the laptop, then pair them again.</string>
  <string name="link_mismatch">the laptop runs a different Edgepad release (protocol %1$s, this app %2$d). Install both from the same release.</string>
