  <string name="link_not_paired">the laptop did not recognise this phone. Choose Pair again to pair with a new code.</string>
  <string name="link_not_this_laptop">a device answered as this laptop but could not prove it. Check that this phone is on the right network.</string>
  <string name="link_pairing_failed">pairing did not finish: the code was not typed on the laptop in time, or not correctly. Tap the laptop to try again with a new code.</string>
